title="Harvard University">Harvard University</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Thesis" title="Thesis">Thesis</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><i><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://hdl.handle.net/2376/4951" class="external text">Phase Transitions, Metallization, Superconductivity and Magnetic Ordering in Dense Carbon Disulfide and Chemical Analogs</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:97%;">(2013)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; "><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Doctoral_advisor" title="Doctoral advisor">Doctoral advisor</a></div></th><td class="infobox-data">Choong-shik Yoo</td></tr><tr style="display:none"><td colspan="2">
